            "value" : "Compact"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compact goes no narrower than leaves room for every tab, and for the eyedropper, battery and gear, beside the camera. With the calendar on, six tabs need more than Default's width there, so Default widens to fit them. Hiding a badge only clears it from beside the closed notch: the timer still chimes and shows when it ends. The recording dot always shows; the camera and microphone indicator has its own switch below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compact goes no narrower than leaves room for every tab, and for the eyedropper, battery and gear, beside the camera. With the calendar on, six tabs need more than Default's width there, so Default widens to fit them. Hiding a badge only clears it from beside the closed notch: the timer still chimes and shows when it ends. The recording dot always shows; the camera and microphone indicator has its own switch below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
