          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera is the only module that costs anything while it runs: the light is on whenever the preview is, and a clip keeps recording if you close the notch. The indicator is notification-driven and costs nothing while nothing is capturing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
